  ],
  "core": [],
  "topic": "冻结全五阶",
  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "doc-c9098f31a0724afad6c3fc",
      "section": "前期运营及应变",
      "text": "开局：优先牛魔、曜、苏烈等容易获取的一阶牌，谁更容易觉醒就围绕谁做第一轮冻结。可以接受适度连败，用最低成本的一阶牌完成觉醒和冻结准备，不要为了保血刷新商店。第一次强化后再决定是否继续留在低级商店寻找低阶单位。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-7cfe17b3d73fbef79e43ee43a2e50b6a2d6eea8fa277439b29aa65f234d12eb2",
          "paragraph_start": 13,
          "paragraph_end": 13
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-f160e3a1beea21dfbfa0a6",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "昭君的第一张冰冻强化优先选择寒冰王座直接把觉醒单位推向五阶，其次选择破冰裂变提高升阶效率或者冰封结晶，获得解冻英雄品阶的兑换券。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-7cfe17b3d73fbef79e43ee43a2e50b6a2d6eea8fa277439b29aa65f234d12eb2",
          "paragraph_start": 5,
          "paragraph_end": 5
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-bfed3cfeaf47f8e67d87f4",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "冻结目标优先选已经有等级，但继续留在当前品阶价值不高的单位，让它在战后升阶并继承原有等级。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-7cfe17b3d73fbef79e43ee43a2e50b6a2d6eea8fa277439b29aa65f234d12eb2",
          "paragraph_start": 6,
          "paragraph_end": 6
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-17ea21de373730818802f2",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "同一张低阶牌不要同时承担太多功能，确定要冻结升阶后，就减少继续为它投入无法转移的临时资源。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-7cfe17b3d73fbef79e43ee43a2e50b6a2d6eea8fa277439b29aa65f234d12eb2",
          "paragraph_start": 7,
          "paragraph_end": 7
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-c65c284fae6cca5fe5349a",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "第一次强化决定整局路线，如果拿到寒冰王座（英雄解冻后直接变成5阶随机英雄），则可以继续卡低级商店找便宜觉醒牌，否则根据选择的强化来决定升级棋手，昭君棋手至多只需要升到棋手四阶就可以启动。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-7cfe17b3d73fbef79e43ee43a2e50b6a2d6eea8fa277439b29aa65f234d12eb2",
          "paragraph_start": 8,
          "paragraph_end": 8
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-15598460b8a9902040f751",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "第二张深度冻结如果选择寒潮共振（场上英雄获得觉醒英雄数量1.5倍的等级），就要主动提高低费觉醒数量，而不是只养一张核心牌。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-7cfe17b3d73fbef79e43ee43a2e50b6a2d6eea8fa277439b29aa65f234d12eb2",
          "paragraph_start": 9,
          "paragraph_end": 9
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-c06d3db62956680e3705ca",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "中期：中期可以上阵公孙离摄灵吸取等级，消化多余等级和战力过渡，把已经积累等级的低阶牌送去冻结，逐渐形成高阶战力。冰之心最好集中在某个英雄身上，先寻找到第一张五阶英雄，防止资源分散。五阶姜子牙或其余高质量核心出现后，再直接把资源和等级集中在主要输出英雄身上，停止无意义的随机换核。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-7cfe17b3d73fbef79e43ee43a2e50b6a2d6eea8fa277439b29aa65f234d12eb2",
          "paragraph_start": 14,
          "paragraph_end": 14
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-83c12716f70b5e6fb89246",
      "section": "后期运营及应变",
      "text": "冻结出来的五阶牌先看质量再决定是否常驻场上，不合适的可以继续冰冻，合适的核心才接完整装备和资源。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-7cfe17b3d73fbef79e43ee43a2e50b6a2d6eea8fa277439b29aa65f234d12eb2",
          "paragraph_start": 10,
          "paragraph_end": 10
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-4c6c67a48cc6c784124127",
      "section": "后期运营及应变",
      "text": "最终目标是把一次次低成本冻结变成多张高阶牌，再从中挑出一到两个最适合当对局的终局核心。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-7cfe17b3d73fbef79e43ee43a2e50b6a2d6eea8fa277439b29aa65f234d12eb2",
          "paragraph_start": 11,
          "paragraph_end": 11
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-016985de7dfbe3f11f0155",
      "section": "后期运营及应变",
      "text": "后期：姜子牙可以作为高价值终局核心之一，司空震、杨玉环等高质量五阶也能根据来牌和装备接管资源。血量健康，就继续提高五阶密度；血量已经危险，就别再贪升阶，直接把冻出来的高阶牌拉上去锁血。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-7cfe17b3d73fbef79e43ee43a2e50b6a2d6eea8fa277439b29aa65f234d12eb2",
          "paragraph_start": 15,
          "paragraph_end": 15
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-606226527f60491277ae93",
      "section": "核心机制",
      "text": "这套没有固定七人名单，核心是王昭君棋手的冻结升阶机制：低阶牌先承担过渡和等级，再通过冻结逐步升到高阶终局单位，把前期养出来的等级完整带进后期。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "mechanic",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-7cfe17b3d73fbef79e43ee43a2e50b6a2d6eea8fa277439b29aa65f234d12eb2",
          "paragraph_start": 2,
          "paragraph_end": 2
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-076e17dca17df47d7d0f12",
      "section": "核心机制",
      "text": "这套阵容不需要搜五阶英雄，而是让低阶牌自己“长成”五阶，从而省下后期商店的大量刷新成本，五阶主要输出英雄按照冰冻结果决定，可以选择姜子牙，其次司空震、杨玉环也可以接管资源。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "mechanic",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-7cfe17b3d73fbef79e43ee43a2e50b6a2d6eea8fa277439b29aa65f234d12eb2",
          "paragraph_start": 3,
          "paragraph_end": 3
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-9657c48877d972a877e82d",
      "section": "后期运营及应变",
      "text": "材料已给出的棋手升级操作按前、中、后期执行；未明确各中间等阶的独立找牌目标、停留边界或六阶后资源安排时，仍待确认。升级前同时比较当前战力、掉血风险、核心与觉醒进度，以及升级后买牌预算；不能仅因到达某回合就忽略保命战力。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": true,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-7cfe17b3d73fbef79e43ee43a2e50b6a2d6eea8fa277439b29aa65f234d12eb2",
          "paragraph_start": 13,
          "paragraph_end": 13
        },
        {
